// ║  An autonomous reasoner that produces cryptographic proof of its own    ║
// ║  cognitive integrity — without revealing WHAT it was thinking about.    ║
// ║                                                                        ║
// ║  Private beliefs (secret<T>). Untrusted sensors (taint_source).        ║
// ║  Verified safety (contracts). Capability-gated action (cap_acquire).   ║
